becom.machine.antenna.hatch=Any base casing
becom.machine.launch_pad.type=Satellite Launch Pad
becom.machine.launch_pad.info=Launches Satellite Rockets from its input bus, each putting one satellite into orbit over this dimension.
becom.machine.launch_pad.launch=A launch takes %s s at %s EU/t, and %s L of rocket fuel from its input hatch. Maintenance problems slow it down.
becom.machine.launch_pad.sky=Needs open sky above the whole pad.
becom.machine.launch_pad.controller=Middle of one edge of the pad
becom.machine.launch_pad.hatch=Any pad casing
becom.machine.satellite_dish.type=Satellite Dish
becom.machine.satellite_dish.info=Joins its network to the satellites over this dimension: to every other dish here and, in the Overworld, to every planet with a Rocket Radio Receiver.
becom.machine.satellite_dish.link=Wrench-link it to an antenna, a Pylon Head or a Line Terminal within %s blocks. Needs at least %s satellites over this dimension, and open sky above the whole dish; rain weakens it.
