becom.machine.portal_relay.pair=To pair: wrench it, go through the portal, and wrench the relay on the far side within %s minutes.
becom.machine.portal_relay.link=Wrench-link it to an antenna, a Pylon Head or a Line Terminal within %s blocks to join its network.
